  "contentHtml": "<p>다른 분이 답변 달아주셨는데 추가로 말씀 드려요~</p><p>저도 여기서 도움받아 눈 모형 만들기를 한지라...^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>쌤이 쓰신 파일 말고 답변에 있는 파일을 저도 사용했구요, 모아찍기해서 쓰니 사이즈 적당하고 좋았습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>수정체와 공막은 OHP필름을 사각형으로 잘라서 나눠줬어요. 큰건 4.5cm 정도, 작은건 3cm 정도로 잘랐구요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그리고 종이 자르는데 시간이 꽤 오래걸려서 1시간안에 잘 안끝나더라구요. 그래서 1장(인쇄하면 총 3장 나와요.)을 미리 전시간에 나눠주고 잘라오게 했어요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>수업시간에는 제가 칠판에 모아찍기 하지 않고 자른 큰 사이즈 조각을 붙여 이 모양대로 자르라고 보여줬습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0bb7ff97d6daf2e831cb75b7df00db07b5313bdf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0bb7ff97d6daf2e831cb75b7df00db07b5313bdf\" data-origin-width=\"810\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b3551d20e129fdecbf0fd976b27f14779abf79c5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b3551d20e129fdecbf0fd976b27f14779abf79c5\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b427a001e8581a2380f3a05daec95a547e4a024f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b427a001e8581a2380f3a05daec95a547e4a024f\" data-origin-width=\"810\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4153d7ba5b01c979ac3c2d08fa35ffa03a3fe87a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4153d7ba5b01c979ac3c2d08fa35ffa03a3fe87a\" data-origin-width=\"810\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8558e908960824b3b439e5d07e8570715e327008\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8558e908960824b3b439e5d07e8570715e327008\" data-origin-width=\"810\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/88514f063540456d4c4f82230b5b01ba246fc961\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/88514f063540456d4c4f82230b5b01ba246fc961\" data-origin-width=\"810\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa2b8c5bd475f7e7b344020ba8c144cd4e78184b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa2b8c5bd475f7e7b344020ba8c144cd4e78184b\" data-origin-width=\"810\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c003c720284cdb5e2061b497037f16b82ca14386\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c003c720284cdb5e2061b497037f16b82ca14386\" data-origin-width=\"810\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1bb015508aaf563e194735ee08357234afb2e65\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1bb015508aaf563e194735ee08357234afb2e65\" data-origin-width=\"810\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
